---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageIntro from "@/components/PageIntro.astro";
import { site } from "@/data/site";
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Dino’s Lab is an independent hardware studio in Ladispoli, near Rome, with a production agreement at Acme Systems."
>
  <div class="shell py-16 lg:py-20">
    <PageIntro kicker="About" title="A small studio, a real line.">
      Independent hardware studio in Ladispoli, in the Rome area. We design
      printed circuit boards and modules, write firmware, and build the software
      that sits around the hardware.
    </PageIntro>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-muted lg:col-span-7">
        <p>
          We are not a large house with a names-on-the-door roster. The studio
          collaborates with professionals in software, hardware, firmware, and
          mechanics as each project needs them.
        </p>
        <p>
          Production is the part most design shops outsource to a distant fab.
          We have a production agreement with{" "}
          <a class="text-ink underline decoration-line underline-offset-2 hover:text-lab" href={site.acme.url}>
            {site.acme.name}
          </a>
          , also in Ladispoli. Their line — pick-and-place, vapour-phase reflow,
          through-hole, test — is the same one behind their own System-on-Module
          products, including the RoadRunner. We use it for Dino’s Lab boards:
          prototypes, small series, and runs of tens of thousands in a month.
        </p>
        <p>
          The catalog is the long game. Custom work is how we start. We speak
          English and take work from anywhere.
        </p>
      </div>

      <dl class="h-fit divide-y divide-line border border-line bg-white lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-[7rem_1fr] gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-sm">
          <dt class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Studio</dt>
          <dd>{site.location}</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-[7rem_1fr] gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-sm">
          <dt class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Production</dt>
          <dd>{site.acme.name}, Ladispoli</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-[7rem_1fr] gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-sm">
          <dt class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">GitHub</dt>
          <dd>
            <a class="hover:text-lab" href={site.github}>{site.githubHandle}</a>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-[7rem_1fr] gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-sm">
          <dt class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Contact</dt>
          <dd>
            <a class="hover:text-lab" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
